From 5b884d372725429fb30b2080f45c021fa64e1315 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Iain Bennett <iain@mathan.ca>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 20:56:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Backport RP2350 erase rounding fix to preserve following
 settings sector

---
 CMakeLists.txt                |  2 +-
 ERASE-FIX.md                  | 28 ++++++++++++++++++
 tests/check_erase_rounding.py | 53 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 ui/uf2.c                      |  7 +++--
 4 files changed, 87 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 ERASE-FIX.md
